  "content": "<h1>沉浸式优化</h1><p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveOptimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p><p>一个实体刻调度器，可大幅减少卡顿（约提升200%性能）并降低实体的资源需求。</p><p>与同类模组不同，本模组不会完全禁用刻更新，让农场或远处的实体仍能正常运作。</p><p>与 Entity Culling 模组搭配效果更佳。</p><h2>Discord</h2><p>\n虽然经过全面测试，但难免存在瑕疵。请将问题反馈至\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveOptimization/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 或\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。\n</p><h2>功能特性</h2><ul>\n<li>逐步降低实体与方块实体的刻更新频率</li>\n<li>将更新分散至多个游戏刻，消除卡顿峰值</li>\n<li>根据服务器负载动态调整刻更新频率</li>\n<li>提供配置指令（<code>/io ...</code>）</li>\n</ul><h2>已测试的整合包</h2><p>具体数值视场景而定，但观察到以下结果：</p><ul>\n<li>在 Cobblemon 1.20.1 Fabric 中性能提升150%</li>\n<li>在含700个模组的私人整合包中性能提升330%（见画廊示例）</li>\n</ul><p><img width=\"547\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=547,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/screenshots/speed.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h1>沉浸式系列</h1><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&amp;description=大量独特且忠于原版的护甲套装。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式护甲\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&amp;description=一系列可用于旅行、运输和探索的复古飞行器！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式飞行器\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&amp;description=用各种乐器演奏自定义旋律，烦扰你的朋友！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式旋律\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&amp;description=拖放、像素化并悬挂美丽的艺术品。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式绘画\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&amp;description=轻量级实体刻调度器，可让你的TPS翻倍。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式优化\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&amp;description=在无关紧要时隐藏丑陋的方块选择轮廓。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"选择性边界\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&amp;description=为沉浸式飞行器提供的一组附加飞行器，兼容Create模组。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"万机之主\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&amp;description=一系列用于运输、采矿和自动化的复古机械。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式机械\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&amp;description=在游戏中创建自定义精美家具，或从庞大的在线库中选择。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式家具\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Gateways&amp;description=散布在主世界的神秘久远传送门。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式传送门\">\n</a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=171524e841d667de68a7e86506eed0b7\" alt=\"用于简化页面部署的页面哈希值。\"></p>",
